{
  "_comment": "Map events ('?' tiles). Each option may cost gold/torch, may roll a check (best hero: d20 + atk|dex|spell|none vs dc) and applies 'success' or 'failure' outcomes. Outcome types: gold, luck, torch, xp, heal (fraction), maxHp (may be negative; never downs a hero), damage (dice, target random|party; never downs a hero), item (id), upgradeRandom, addCard (optional rarity), removeCard, fight (kind normal|elite, surprise = heroes have advantage in round 1, optional enemies = exact ids; starts when the event closes). minDepth limits an event to deeper levels. Names and text are original. Round 10 gear outcomes: gear (optional rarity; amount = how many to choose from; optional id), improveGear (best equipped weapon/armor/shield +1, max +2), cursedGear (id).",
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "shrine",
      "title": "Cracked Shrine",
      "text": "A hairline-cracked shrine hums softly. Old coins glint in its bowl.",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Pray",
          "text": "Spell check DC 12",
          "check": {
            "mod": "spell",
            "dc": 12
          },
          "success": [
            {
              "type": "luck",
              "amount": "1"
            },
            {
              "type": "heal",
              "amount": "0.2"
            }
          ],
          "failure": [
